<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Sigma-Aldrich view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Sigma-Aldrich view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said it upgraded its intermediate six-month rating on Sigma-Aldrich Corp stock to outperform from market performer.</p>
<p>--It noted that the company matched the firm's third-quarter earnings estimate of $0.74.</p>
<p>--EVEREN also said it raised its price objective on the stock to $75 from $65 for the six months and to $66 from $62 for the 18-month long term.</p>
<p>--Sigma-Aldrich closed Friday at 57, up 3/4.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
